Conducting audits of policy and compliance to standards, including liaison with internal and external auditors;
Undertaking capacity building and awareness on Enterprise Risk Management, including legal and regulatory compliance in the University.
Provision of secretariat and other support for Risk Management Committee.
Performing any other duties as may be assigned by the immediate Supervisor.
